Package: JASPAR
Type: Package
Encoding: UTF-8
Title: Data package for JASPAR databases
Version: 0.99.8
Authors@R: person(given = "Damir", family = "Baranasic", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "damir.baranasic@lms.mrc.ac.uk", 
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5948-0932"))
Description: Retrieves the JASPAR databases of transcription factor binding
             profiles through AnnotationHub. JASPAR is an open-access database
             of curated, non-redundant DNA binding profiles of transcription
             factors, stored as position frequency matrices. Each JASPAR release
             from 2022 onwards is an SQLite file registered in AnnotationHub.
             JASPAR() downloads the release you ask for once, keeps it in the
             AnnotationHub cache and returns its path, which can be searched
             with TFBSTools or queried with RSQLite.
             getAvailableJASPARVersions() lists the releases registered in the
             hub.
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0), methods
